# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /pets
-  the `` request property default value `9007199254740992.00` was removed
-  the `status/oneOf[subschema #3]/` request property's min was unset from `7.00`
-  request property `status/oneOf[subschema #3]/` reactivated
-  the `status/oneOf[subschema #3]/` request property `type/format` was widened from `integer, null/int64` to `any`






